+## Android Support
+
+miniCar now builds on Android using Android Studio and the Android NDK. 
+
+### Android Requirements
+
+- Android Studio 2022.1 or later
+- Android NDK (25.1 or compatible)
+- Android API level 21+ (minimum), 33+ (target)
+
+### Android Build
+
+#### Using Android Studio:
+1. Open the project in Android Studio
+2. Select your device/emulator
+3. Click "Run" → "Run 'app'" (Shift+F10)
+
+#### Using Command Line:
+```bash
+# Debug build
+./gradlew assembleDebug
+
+# Release build
+./gradlew assembleRelease
+
+# Install on device
+./gradlew installDebug
+```
+
+#### Using VSCode:
+- VSCode tasks available:
+  - "Build Android (Debug)"
+  - "Build Android (Release)"
+
+### Android Notes
+
+- Entry point: `src/android_main.cpp` (JNI interface via SDL2)
+- Orientation: Landscape enforced
+- Audio: Beep tones only (espeak-ng not available)
+- Touch controls: Not yet implemented (keyboard-only for now)
+
+For detailed platform-specific build instructions, see [BUILD_GUIDE.md](BUILD_GUIDE.md).
+
